/E (Amelia Arabe is a Filipino American artist and systems engineer based in Elysian Valley, Los Angeles. Often described as a Renaissance woman, she brings a wide range of interests and disciplines to her creative practice. Oil painting is her calm in the storm. Working primarily in oil on canvas, Amelia captures moments of pure bliss and translates the emotions she felt within those spaces into layered, deeply personal works.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
